WEBVTT

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.270
An election?

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:15.940
The New Round Table Conference,
or the Akiba Government...

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:18.440
We'll let the residents decide.

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:20.190
Let the residents decide?

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:22.650
In meetings such as the Conference of Lords,

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:24.900
they certainly have
a majority vote system, but...

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:29.480
We'll do it with all
50 thousand Akiba residents.

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:31.650
F-Fifty thousand?!

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:35.310
As expected, what Adventurers
think sure is grand...

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:38.810
Now that that's been decided,
there are a lot of things to do to prepare.

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:42.060
If we're going to do it, then we must win.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.560
Hey, I thought you guys decided
to keep your distance from the Round Table.

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:48.190
If we lose, it won't be funny.

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't wanna manage logistics
under that fish noble.

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:54.850
Then why don't you lead this whole thing?

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:58.940
Speaking of leading, Isaac,
it should be you, right?

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:02.730
It's been decided that
we'll look after Prince Ithe.

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:05.560
Either way, we won't be able to put Akiba first.

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:09.020
You're two-timing! Hey, everyone!
We've got a two-timer!

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:10.600
You are too!

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:13.100
The biggest distinction
of the New Round Table is

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:15.650
the People of the Land's participation.

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:19.190
Princess Rayneshia. I think
you're most suitable for the task.

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:20.440
Me?

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:23.230
I request that you be
a candidate in the election.

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:27.980
I can't! I can't! I can't!
There is no way I can!

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:29.940
I am not at all suitable for...

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:32.900
Didn't you wear that uniform
to show your resolve?

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:34.230
But...

00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:41.850
Here we go. Sir Shiroe in Dark Kuroe mode...

