00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:17.730
Princess, in order to gain your freedom,
what you need to do first is

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:20.560
become independent from the Cowen Family.

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:25.400
To do so, there's someone you need to overcome.

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:27.520
You know who that is, right?

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:32.310
No matter what they say,
you shouldn't think you're being scolded.

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:35.400
If you think they're just entertaining you,

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:37.900
your relationship with
your bosses will go smoother.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:40.400
Thank you very much for your advice!

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.650
They are not my bosses, though...

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:51.250
Akiba General Election

00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:50.060
"Akiba General Election."

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:53.500
Cinderella Castle - Maihama

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:10.900
I will not permit it.

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:12.310
Mother...

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:13.900
I will not allow it.

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:19.980
She is so unapproachable!

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:23.690
This is just natural since
I refused to marry into the Saiguu Family

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:26.020
and said I want to live in Akiba forever.

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:28.770
Oh no...! What a scary face!

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:32.600
If I carelessly say something rebellious,
who knows what will happen!

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:38.190
Excuse me. Could you tell us
what the issue is in detail?

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:42.480
There are many issues.
First, one issue is with her ability.

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:46.020
Rayneshia said she wanted to continue
carrying out her work in Akiba,

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:49.270
but has she really been able to handle it?

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:52.770
The next one is the issue of trust.

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:56.270
If I am to use a common phrase,
how she makes a living.

00:04:56.270 --> 00:05:00.600
The salaries for the maids at the
Suifuu Mansion as well as its maintenance...

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:04.100
How are you going to pay for them from now on?

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:08.690
As I was afraid, I cannot do this.
I am no match for her.

00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:11.940
Is your mom that high-caliber?

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:17.150
Yes. Her diplomatic sense especially
is said to surpass my father's.

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:18.600
En garde!

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:22.270
I am not done yet!

00:05:23.770 --> 00:05:27.100
Then, wouldn't it be good if
your mom succeeds first as the head?

00:05:27.100 --> 00:05:30.150
Is it possible you are stupid, Mr. Isaac?

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:33.270
"Stu--"?! Drop that "Mr." anyway!

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:37.600
Women do not handle state affairs;
they have them handled for them.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:40.650
As a matter of fact,
my sister is like that too, right?

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:42.940
I see...

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:44.770
Yeah...

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:50.900
You mentioned issues with her ability earlier.

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:54.440
But we, Shopping Street 8, can vouch for her.

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:56.900
Because we thought
the princess was essential to Akiba,

00:05:56.900 --> 00:06:00.940
we requested her presence in Akiba
to Lord Serjiad to begin with.

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:02.690
Indeed.

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:05.940
What she brought to Akiba as a counselor

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:08.900
and what she will bring
in the future are immeasurable.

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:10.560
Sir Karashin...

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:13.350
Then what about funds?

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:15.770
No need to worry about it, Madam.

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:26.060
We have not touched the money
and goods provided by Maihama at all.

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:30.100
What? I did not know that!
No one has told me that, Elissa!

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:33.980
Thanks to our princess'
splendid work serving as a counselor,

00:06:33.980 --> 00:06:37.900
we have a steady income from
mediation fees, commissions, etc.

00:06:37.900 --> 00:06:41.480
So I do not think that we need
to worry about the funds.

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:47.770
I thought that we at the Suifuu Mansion
were so poor I had to work part time.

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:50.270
What are the maids at the mansion saying?

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:52.810
There is no problem with them, either.

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:58.730
They all wish to continue working
at the Suifuu Mansion.

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:03.560
I too, of course, am prepared
to attend our princess.

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:05.810
I see.

00:07:05.810 --> 00:07:06.730
Rayneshia.

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:08.310
Y-Y-Yes?

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:15.150
All right. I acknowledge that you
have been serving plebeians in Akiba.

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:16.690
Yes, Mother.

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:20.940
You are cooperating
to cement the position of Itherus.

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:24.310
You do not have ambition. I understand all that.

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:26.520
However...

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:28.150
...it only appears to me

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:33.190
as if you are about to set off on
your own path with naïve expectations.

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:36.770
Are you not just being sweet-talked
into this by the people around you?

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:38.400
That is not the case.

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:44.350
Then persuade your grandfather
and me with your own words.

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:49.850
Go ahead.

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:07.770
Grandfather. Mother.

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:12.600
I probably cannot persuade you two.

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:16.980
But I <i>can</i> root for myself.

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:19.900
Supporting those who take a new step forward

00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:23.100
is my role as a princess in Akiba.

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:25.190
So...

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:27.600
I do not have to get your permission.

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:33.690
"If you're not upset
when something is taken away,

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:36.690
it couldn't have been yours from the start."

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:40.690
I will start the New Round Table Conference.

00:08:40.690 --> 00:08:43.020
By working together with Adventurers,

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:47.520
we will determine the new way Akiba should be.

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:53.690
And... I will be sure to go meet
that undependable Guardian Knight.

00:08:53.690 --> 00:08:57.350
I will be sure to make him say uncle.

00:08:57.350 --> 00:08:59.900
Yes. He will say uncle.

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:02.190
Rayneshia...

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:08.600
My mother often used to look up
at the sky from the window, too.

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:09.810
Hm?

00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:15.520
I sometimes wonder
how she really wanted to live.

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:18.520
Who knows...

00:09:22.230 --> 00:09:27.810
Rayneshia. What you are planning
to do is deviating from the path of nobles.

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:32.190
It means you will part from the Cowen Family.

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:35.020
Are you prepared for it?

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:36.350
Yes.

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:42.190
Mother. I will take the path
you might have been able to walk.

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:48.900
When the Saiguu Family brought
a proposal of engagement, you said,

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:52.230
"Be prepared... so there will be no regrets."

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:55.810
You did not say to accept
the proposal, not even once.

00:09:55.810 --> 00:10:00.190
So as someone with Cowen Family blood,

00:10:00.190 --> 00:10:02.100
as a granddaughter of Grandfather,

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:05.980
and a daughter of Father and Mother,
I will choose my path.

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:15.230
All right.

00:10:15.230 --> 00:10:17.270
Then go, Rayneshia.

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:24.190
As someone with Cowen Family blood,
make a name for yourself in Akiba.

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:25.650
Yes, Mother!

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:30.270
Luquenje Hall, Guild Building

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:28.310
In this world, since family registers are vague

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:31.560
and even the concept of
permanent residency is unclear,

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:34.400
managing elections in
a perfect manner is difficult.

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:39.270
There's also a question of
where the Akiba's city boundary is.

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:43.350
For those reasons, we hastily
decided on the following two rules:

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:45.690
everyone who comes to the polls on election day

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:48.310
will be considered Akiba residents,

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:50.560
and one person can only cast one vote.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:55.420
Election

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:52.520
Although it's a very primitive system,

00:10:52.520 --> 00:10:55.520
we thought this was the best choice
under the current conditions.

00:10:55.520 --> 00:10:57.690
We'll have an election next week, huh?

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:57.710
Election Venue - Akiba

00:10:57.690 --> 00:11:01.310
Does it matter either way?
I've never voted before.

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:03.940
No matter who you vote for,
it won't make any difference.

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:05.900
Hey, hey!

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:09.060
Are you guys like that in our old world, too?

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:11.020
Voting is our right.

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:14.150
If you don't exercise your rights, it means

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:17.350
no matter how much you wanna
complain about Akiba in the future,

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:20.190
you don't even have the right to do so.

00:11:20.190 --> 00:11:21.730
Jeez...

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:26.020
Anyway, I'm surprised Eins
actually agreed to it.

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:28.250
Log Horizon Guild Hall - Akiba

00:11:26.020 --> 00:11:28.650
Of course he would with these conditions.

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:32.480
"Akiba belongs to the duke,
so those with the Round Table need to leave."

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:37.190
If that's all he cares about,
then he'd take extreme measures.

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:42.980
It's an abundant and prosperous Akiba
that Eins and the Saiguu Family want.

00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:45.940
So, they have to think
about post-election Akiba, huh?

00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:52.060
Right. If we brutally fight without
talking it out, the scar will be too big.

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:56.310
Shiroe.

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:58.270
Oh, it's you, Minori.

00:11:58.270 --> 00:12:00.060
We're finally having an election, huh?

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:03.810
I'll root for Princess Rayneshia
with all my might!

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:05.520
Yeah. Thanks!

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:09.520
What's essential for
an election is posters, right?

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:11.190
I made one!

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:11.830
Please vote for me.

00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:13.690
Tada!

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:18.600
Shiroe! Never mind her!

00:12:18.600 --> 00:12:20.600
We carelessly took our eyes off her, and...

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:24.850
What?! What's wrong?!

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:24.850
Please pretend that you didn't see it!

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:28.310
Hometown Clubhouse

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:28.310
Hometown Clubhouse - Akiba

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:29.770
That's right! Whether you're
an Adventurer or a Person of the Land,

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:32.650
you have the equal right to cast one vote.

00:12:32.650 --> 00:12:35.900
Oh, I know! It's like the
one at a village meeting, right?

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:38.900
But that's one vote per household.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:42.270
So this has nothing to do
with us rootless wanderers.

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:46.900
No, everyone who's in Akiba
on election day has the right to vote.

00:12:46.900 --> 00:12:50.190
It's an epoch-making, excellent system!

00:12:50.190 --> 00:12:52.980
Even we can take part in politics, too?!

00:12:52.980 --> 00:12:55.600
That's incredible!
We definitely have to go vote!

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:57.940
"Akiba General Election"

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:05.440
The New Round Table Conference
will be responsible for Akiba's future!

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:09.400
Please vote for Princess Rayneshia,
the Winter Rose of Eastal!

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:14.520
m 913 70 l 1223 70 1223 100 913 100

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:14.520
Rayneshia El Arte Cowen

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:14.980
Um... Does an election
require this kind of activity?

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:13.020
Princess! I'm rooting for you!

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:14.980
Kick Eins to the curb!

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:17.350
You're quite popular.

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:20.190
Oh yeah!

