00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:34.020
I'm not liked by Adventurers, so...

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:35.480
Is that right?

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:37.900
Nonetheless, the population
of the Akiba Adventurers

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:39.480
is a little over 10,000.

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:42.020
The People of the Land
are at least three times that.

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:46.810
They're commoners in poverty.
All we need to do is give them food and shelter.

00:13:46.810 --> 00:13:48.560
Just pass them out.

00:13:48.560 --> 00:13:52.230
If a little thing like this can gain
their support, this is nothing.

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:55.480
It seems support isn't the only thing we gained.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:56.810
Hm?

