00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:03.310
Eins's got the overwhelming lead.

00:15:03.310 --> 00:15:05.770
I didn't expect it to be this large.

00:15:05.770 --> 00:15:07.900
Did we miscalculate it?

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:14.230
Why? The People of the Land
like the princess. She's popular!

00:15:14.230 --> 00:15:17.270
I do get how they feel, though.

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:21.400
The Saiguu Family is special to them, after all.

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:25.770
And the princess turned down
the engagement proposal. I think this is big.

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:30.600
Why? They're the ones who acted
without consulting her, right?

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:34.060
In noble society,
it's more senseless to turn it down.

00:15:34.060 --> 00:15:39.600
On top of that, what if this causes
relations with Westelande to worsen?

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:41.600
They're worried about it.

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:46.060
Rudicchi has a point.

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:50.770
We are at an overwhelming
disadvantage from the start.

00:15:50.770 --> 00:15:55.270
I am sorry for dragging you down.

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:57.980
It's nothing you should
feel bad about, Princess.

