00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:44.440
Here we go! Pheromone!
Pheromone! Pheromone! Phero--

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:44.440
Hey, Tetora! What're you doing holding
a general election on your own here?!

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:46.190
Oh, Naotsugu!

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:49.350
Guys! Vote for me, the Starlet Party leader!

00:16:49.350 --> 00:16:53.900
They won't! We're not
accepting a third candidate.

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:58.190
Capture!

00:16:58.190 --> 00:17:00.400
Ugh! Wait, wait, wait!

00:17:00.400 --> 00:17:04.560
If I can't stand in the center,
the axis of this planet will incline!

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:08.480
Noooo! I'm a starlet, you know!

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:06.540
Be quiet!

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:11.770
I feel so embarrassed about
genuinely panicking that I could die.

00:17:11.770 --> 00:17:14.770
Tetora needs a purrnishment.

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:19.350
Still, this doesn't change the situation
that Rayneshia's at a disadvantage.

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:21.440
Yeah.

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:23.270
I need to help her.

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:26.560
Election
Day:
June 1

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:26.560
Two days remaining

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:26.980
We're down to two days left, huh?

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:30.100
Our campaign measures are perfect, Naotsugu.

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:34.980
Come to think of it, you've been
going out every night. What're you doing?

00:17:39.520 --> 00:17:41.270
That was close!

00:17:42.480 --> 00:17:43.770
Ow, ow, ow...

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:45.910
"Yakitori"

00:17:47.310 --> 00:17:49.600
Why is everyone sleep deprived?

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:04.400
You like Rayneshia so much
that you'll want to vote for her.

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:11.480
You want to be like Rayneshia.
So, you'll want to vote for her.

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:16.350
You'll want to vote for Rayneshia.

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:17.850
You will...

00:18:17.850 --> 00:18:20.190
With this, there's no mistaking it.
The princess will win.

00:18:20.190 --> 00:18:21.850
This is nothing <i>but</i> mistakes!

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:25.440
Come stop by! We have Rayneshia steamed buns!

